        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Films: Where's Officer Tuba?\n- People: Joey Wong, Philip Chan, Ricky Lau, Sammo Hung, David Chiang, Jacky Cheung\n- Topics: Hong Kong cinema, actors, directors\n\nFacts:\n- Where's Officer Tuba? is a 1986 Hong Kong action comedy film.\n- Where's Officer Tuba? was directed by Philip Chan and Ricky Lau.\n- Where's Officer Tuba? stars Sammo Hung, David Chiang, Jacky Cheung, and Joey Wong.\n- Joey Wong Cho-Yee was born on January 31, 1967.\n- Joey Wong Cho-Yee is also known as Joey Wang, Wang Tsu Hsien, and Joey Ong Jyo Han or Hen.\n- Joey Wong Cho-Yee is a Taiwanese-born actress based in Hong Kong.",
